          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ses gros bras sont sa plus grande fierté. Si vous voulez devenir un Dresseur de Pandarbare, il va falloir jouer des poings !",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "It boasts superb physical strength. Those who wish to become Pangoro’s Trainer have no choice but to converse with their fists.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "腕っぷしが　自慢で　豪快。 ゴロンダの　トレーナーに　なりたいなら 拳で　語り合う　しかない。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/27/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "たけの　はっぱの　ゆれで　てきの うごきを　よむ。　ケンカっぱやいが なかまへの　じょうは　あつい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Il peut détecter les mouvements ennemis grâce aux vibrations de sa feuille. Avec ses amis, ce grand lunatique a en fait le cœur sur la main.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "From the slight twitches of its bamboo leaf, it deduces its opponent’s movements. It’s eager to tussle but kindhearted toward its companions.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "竹の　葉っぱの　揺れで　敵の 動きを　読む。　ケンカっ早いが 仲間への　情は　厚い。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "moon",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/28/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "うでっぷしが　じまんの　ワイルドな ポケモン。　ごうかいな　せいしつに ほれこむ　トレーナーも　おおい。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja-Hrkt",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/1/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon féroce est très fier de ses gros bras. Beaucoup de Dresseurs l’apprécient pour son côté truculent.",
        "language": {
          "name": "fr",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/5/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "This rowdy Pokémon boasts great physical strength. Many Trainers are also smitten by its lively character.",
        "language": {
          "name": "en",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/9/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "腕っ節が　自慢の　ワイルドな ポケモン。　豪快な　性質に 惚れこむ　トレーナーも　多い。",
        "language": {
          "name": "ja",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/language/11/"
        },
        "version": {
          "name": "ultra-sun",
          "url": "https://pokeapi.co/api/v2/version/29/"
        }
      },
      {
        "flavor_text": "こぶしで　かたる　タイプ。　ガタガタ いわず　ぶんなぐり　ダンプカーも ふっとばす　とっしんを　かます。",
        "language": {
